Upstream-Name: bun
Upstream-Contact: https://github.com/oven-sh/bun/issues
Source: https://github.com/oven-sh/bun
Comment:
 The binary is upstream's release build. It statically links JavaScriptCore
 and WebKit (LGPL-2), tinycc (LGPL-2.1) and other libraries, and embeds
 polyfills; /usr/share/doc/bun/LICENSE.md lists each with its license. That
 file also says how to relink Bun with a changed JavaScriptCore; the patched
 WebKit is at https://github.com/oven-sh/WebKit.

